meta {
  name: 12b. Cleanup - Delete the pending FROST DataSink
  type: http
  seq: 40
}

delete {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/datasets/:dataSetId/datasinks/:id
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:path {
  dataSetId: {{sagaDataSetId}}
  id: {{sagaDataSinkId}}
}

tests {
  test("A PENDING_UNPROVISION DataSink is not found", function() {
    const status = res.getStatus();
    // 404=marked PENDING_UNPROVISION by step 15a, 400=sagaDataSinkId never set (aborted run)
    expect(status === 404 || status === 400).to.be.true;
  });
}

docs {
  **Saga step 12b** — Delete the FROST DataSink after step 15a made it inactive.

  Step 15a marked the provisioned FROST DataSink `PENDING_UNPROVISION`. Such a DataSink waits only for its storage to be removed: the DataSink endpoints no longer return it, and get, update and delete answer `404`. The dataset delete in step 13 removes its FROST project and then the record.

  **Expected Response:** 404 Not Found. 400 if `sagaDataSinkId` is not set (first run / aborted earlier).

  **System Impact:**

  | Layer | Effect |
  |---|---|
  | Backend | — (DataSink record kept as `PENDING_UNPROVISION`) |
  | Config Adapter | — |
}
